  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The repository backup service was provided by modeshape out of the box and thus was easy to offer.  Does it still make sense in an OCFL world? ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This ticket's task is to answer that question.  If the answer is \"no\", the output of this task is a Jira or JIRAs for removing backup.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
